"...Well, it does glow, yes, but
it's probably not in the way you're imagining;
more like, a rainbow-colored sort of—"

いえ……走り物を\n最高の形で味わえるよう仕上げるには\n丁寧に、手間をかける必:
No... in order to bring out the absolute best flavor
from produce in its prime,
one must take great care and effort.

うんっ！ 『桜花賞』と同じで……\nティアラ路線のウマ娘同士、\n負けられない距:
Yeah! Just like the Oka Sho...
for Umamusume on the Tiara route,
it's a distance we just can't afford to lose at.

えっ……じゃあ\n逆に覚えきれなかったら\nクラフトさんは1日中――？:
Huh... Then on the flip side,
if you can't memorize it all,
Craft-san will be—all day?

はい、ヴィクトリー倶楽部の打ち上げで\nお世話になってたころから、\nずっと変わ:
Yes, ever since we frequented this place
for our Victory Club wrap-up parties,
it's been just as delicious as always...!

イランイランの発汗作用で血流をよくし、\nラベンダーで同時にリラックスさせること:
Ylang-ylang promotes sweating to improve blood flow,
while lavender simultaneously relaxes you,
making it effective for reducing stress!

雲雀東風が幾たび吹けど、\nただ受けるのみにて\n変わるものなどございませんでし:
No matter how often the spring breeze blows,
if one merely receives it passively,
nothing is bound to change, is it?

趣味嗜好は異なれど、\n詳細にリストアップして精査すれば、\n必ず見つかるかと。:
Even if our tastes and preferences differ,
if we list them out in detail and examine them carefully,
I am certain we will find it.

